          "claim": "Conjugation sends K0 inverse and every finite coefficient to its D-conjugate, so S is coefficientwise covariant. Differentiating KS=I yields delta S=-S(delta K)S; differentiating D_s gives delta K=i[Theta,K], hence delta S=i[Theta,S].",
